I guess it's also about individual differences. Some middle-aged guys might be very tech-savvy and keep up with modern trends, while others might not. Similarly, some teens might be more open to exploring a variety of technologies and communication methods, while others might be more resistant to change. So, it's not necessarily a generational issue, but more about personal preferences and levels of adaptability.

